  "content": "<h1>ObsidianUI</h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"forge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"fabric\"></p><p>本模組是<a href=\"https://github.com/LambdAurora/SpruceUI\" rel=\"nofollow\">SpruceUI</a>的Forge移植版本。</p><p>ObsidianUI是一個Minecraft模組API，提供多種GUI工具。它是一個用於創建和管理GUI的函式庫，包含按鈕、文字框、滑桿等常見元件。</p>",
